                    {
                        "form_id": "c0fd894f-6716-4b17-a5c6-6970c2d007c8",
                        "entry_id": "ed64bb75-1706-3a8a-8d80-6ea4df796298",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "парча́х"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0b111b21-f335-37e7-bc2c-94373ea8b112",
                        "entry_id": "ed64bb75-1706-3a8a-8d80-6ea4df796298",
                        "glosses": [
                            "текст. фасонная сложноузорчатая шёлковая декоративная ткань, использующаяся для шитья парадных платьев, национальных и театральных костюмов, отделок и т. п. (в старину узор формировался из золотых и серебряных нитей на шёлковой основе, в настоящее время — из нитей или мишуры на полотне)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f791fa90-2eb0-434e-a0b9-a68049e7d093",
                                "sense_id": "0b111b21-f335-37e7-bc2c-94373ea8b112",
                                "text": "Особенно замечательны великолепные парчи фабрики господ Сапожниковых."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5473051c-460f-402e-a7d5-98baf4b1d12e",
                                "sense_id": "0b111b21-f335-37e7-bc2c-94373ea8b112",
                                "text": "Был стол, при взгляде на который богобоязненный буфетчик вздрогнул: стол был покрыт церковной парчой."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5ea6e52a-1c12-3f07-830d-98e5e5e14e20",
                        "entry_id": "ed64bb75-1706-3a8a-8d80-6ea4df796298",
                        "glosses": [
                            "одежда из такой ткани"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e2f2b651-c68e-4a48-b1cb-769c6a084eac",
                                "sense_id": "5ea6e52a-1c12-3f07-830d-98e5e5e14e20",
                                "text": "При виде царя, одетого в золотую парчу, опирающегося на узорный посох, разбойники стали на колени и преклонили головы."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6ae7ba1b-54a9-479c-8351-accdada993f9",
                        "source_entry_id": "ed64bb75-1706-3a8a-8d80-6ea4df796298",
                        "source_sense_description": "фасонная сложноузорчатая шёлковая декоративная ткань",
                        "target_lang_word": "brocade",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "brocade",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b555d967-00dd-3445-bc30-96f711e68d76",
                                        "entry_id": "ffa36f19-e540-39c8-904f-bf91baeedc94",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A thick heavy fabric into which raised patterns have been woven, originally in gold and silver; more recently any cloth incorporating raised, woven patterns."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "529755d1-23f3-4d00-9903-bfb245594203",
                                                "sense_id": "b555d967-00dd-3445-bc30-96f711e68d76",
                                                "text": "Madame Legarde, the \"glass of fashion and the nurse of form,\" (alias the most fashionable of milliners,) has comfortably assured me, \"that my figure has great merit, and only requires cultivation:\" this is to be done by tissues, brocades, and laces, which are now scattered round me in charming confusion."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "97605c88-c2fe-4672-98a5-ed6ccd9e6806",
                                                "sense_id": "b555d967-00dd-3445-bc30-96f711e68d76",
                                                "text": "… his desire to stand in brocade and sing Rhadames in Aida was like my eagerness to go far, far beyond fellow intellectuals of my generation who had lost the imaginative soul."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0bec5f5f-08e6-4586-95a4-240292b116ed",
                                                "sense_id": "b555d967-00dd-3445-bc30-96f711e68d76",
                                                "text": "I selected a pair of loose, dark trousers bound at the waist with a russet sash, a tunic with an open neck and large pockets, and a cloak of the true fuligin of that guild of which I am still officially a master, lined with particolored brocade."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ee6194ff-f877-390f-a93b-36d712eb74e0",
                                        "entry_id": "ffa36f19-e540-39c8-904f-bf91baeedc94",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An item decorated with brocade."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1556e8d2-af91-3818-9109-ca001f2382b2",
                                        "entry_id": "ffa36f19-e540-39c8-904f-bf91baeedc94",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of several species of noctuid moths such as some species in the genera Calophasia and Hadena"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "00f52374-0c2f-46a3-b614-107ace2cb75b",
                                                "sense_id": "1556e8d2-af91-3818-9109-ca001f2382b2",
                                                "text": "Other species considered occasional migrants have become established in the UK in recent years, such as the ... sombre brocade, Blair's mocha, Flame brocade, and Clifden nonpareil."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0993c0c4-9145-3e0e-b0d6-4b80e042ed96",
                                        "entry_id": "ffa36f19-e540-39c8-904f-bf91baeedc94",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A decorative pattern."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7868850d-41f9-43dc-a4ff-a06bed92d3b6",
                                                "sense_id": "0993c0c4-9145-3e0e-b0d6-4b80e042ed96",
                                                "text": "The shrubbery around the cottages is a brocade of lawns and shrubs intermixed, in fancy patterns, with gravel walks, in various directions, which wind into the woods."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "23f33700-7a9d-45eb-8df4-e041adbc10fe",
                                                "sense_id": "0993c0c4-9145-3e0e-b0d6-4b80e042ed96",
                                                "text": "It is as though the poets and mystics were weaving a colorful brocade of words with the intention to please God and to show His greatness to the world."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8b439982-ecb0-45fd-88ad-2c0aad471d96",
                                                "sense_id": "0993c0c4-9145-3e0e-b0d6-4b80e042ed96",
                                                "text": "Saying this, Rikyu stepped into the garden, shook a tree and scattered over the garden gold and crimson leaves, scraps of the brocade of autumn!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "brocade",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3ec3519e-8816-3eba-8170-2362410f35b9",
                                        "entry_id": "e3be1054-5266-38a1-8a66-1d794fa99196",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To decorate fabric with raised woven patterns."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a3628527-7ac8-43ff-829f-2377c284be21",
                        "source_entry_id": "ed64bb75-1706-3a8a-8d80-6ea4df796298",
                        "source_sense_description": "фасонная сложноузорчатая шёлковая декоративная ткань",
                        "target_lang_word": "samite",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "samite",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "42bd90a4-2b0a-3ac9-ac97-ebaad4d32ebe",
                                        "entry_id": "28226d80-8d5a-3aac-a560-b046411821f9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A material of rich silk, sometimes with gold threads, especially prized during the Middle Ages."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "56ec1233-170f-4e68-869e-1d37ea0b6311",
                                                "sense_id": "42bd90a4-2b0a-3ac9-ac97-ebaad4d32ebe",
                                                "text": "[A] robe / Of samite without price, that more exprest / Than hid her, clung about her lissome limbs, / In colour like the satin-shining palm / On sallows in the windy gleams of March: [...]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c466bb94-5ff1-48e2-a0ff-388187bad27d",
                                                "sense_id": "42bd90a4-2b0a-3ac9-ac97-ebaad4d32ebe",
                                                "text": "And in the center of that lake there hath for some time been seen the appearance as of a women's arm--exceedingly beautiful and clad in white samite, and the hand of this arm holdeth a sword of such exceeding excellence and beauty that no eye hath ever beheld like."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bb540d32-0a7c-4a7c-9ad9-b9b7dbf7d8fb",
                        "source_entry_id": "ed64bb75-1706-3a8a-8d80-6ea4df796298",
